   <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XkgMaS5gbaA?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">The Roses</h2>\n<p>A tinderbox of competition and resentments underneath the façade of a picture-perfect couple is ignited when the husband's professional dreams come crashing down.</p>\n<p>Stars Olivia Colman, Benedict Cumberbatch, Kate McKinnon<br><em>(Certification 15)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-11-09&amp;default_time=6:00PM&amp;client_id=1c64db27ef68810076dd1ed13b0bc06138423d33ac22cba2fe545266a0392f26dc92ebbd3dd9bea18feccc1a5077e4c15931a62a38b646b8e6033d02cfd0853d\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-11-09&amp;default_time=6:00PM&amp;client_id=1c64db27ef68810076dd1ed13b0bc06138423d33ac22cba2fe545266a0392f26dc92ebbd3dd9bea18feccc1a5077e4c15931a62a38b646b8e6033d02cfd0853d\">CHARLOTTE STREET HOTEL - SUNDAY 9TH NOVEMBER, 6PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"