sletter.jpg?width=425&format=webp&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=375&format=webp&v=1dc428331dda2f0\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=960&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=960&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=960&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=720&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=980&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=425&v=1dc428331dda2f0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=375&v=1dc428331dda2f0\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &#x27;After the Hunt&#x27;. A woman dressed in smart clothing can be seen sat at a table staring sternly at someone off screen\" src=\"/media/e40i0fon/ath-newsletter.jpg?width=375&amp;v=1dc428331dda2f0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/A8R6DMlDtxk?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">After the Hunt</h2>\n<p>A college professor finds herself at a personal and professional crossroads when a star pupil levels an accusation against one of her colleagues and a dark secret from her own past threatens to come to light.</p>\n<p>Stars Julia Roberts, Ayo Edebiri, Andrew Garfield<br><em>(Certification 15)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-11-09&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=c8de2b08aa373f9bd8faafb3a08ead6045dbbcf95545a004f363c6f43138f39190b14cfadb99c820e364b7552ab5b735f5c6726eae470f7f18a94d91c1eeb0c1\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-11-09&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=c8de2b08aa373f9bd8faafb3a08ead6045dbbcf95545a004f363c6f43138f39190b14cfadb99c820e364b7552ab5b735f5c6726eae470f7f18a94d91c1eeb0c1\">THE SOHO HOTEL - SUNDAY 9TH NOVEMBER, 3:30PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <