30/roofman-3.jpg?width=980&v=1dc428356e269a0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/0dngn330/roofman-3.jpg?width=425&v=1dc428356e269a0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/0dngn330/roofman-3.jpg?width=375&v=1dc428356e269a0\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &#x27;Roofman&#x27;. A man in a tshirt can be seen slowly emerging from a escape hatch in a roof.\" src=\"/media/0dngn330/roofman-3.jpg?width=375&amp;v=1dc428356e269a0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/GXecSGmQDEI?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Roofman</h2>\n<p>A charismatic criminal, while on the run from the police, hides on the roof of a toy store. There, he adopts a new identity and becomes involved with an employee, beginning a relationship as unlikely as it is risky.</p>\n<p>Stars Channing Tatum, Kirsten Dunst, LaKeith Stanfield<br><em>(Certification 12A)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-11-16&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=6dbbc0729d578152fe52fa376245b751f3d7de742c81a95b5a4da2b32458f16181feea8f775c92897079ba3765f47f9879fa6538be1578f50eac1da152fb9e07\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-11-16&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=6dbbc0729d578152fe52fa376245b751f3d7de742c81a95b5a4da2b32458f16181feea8f775c92897079ba3765f47f9879fa6538be1578f50eac1da152fb9e07\">THE SOHO HOTEL - SUNDAY 16TH NOVEMBER, 3:30PM</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-11-30&amp;default_time=5:00PM&amp;client_id=660c831ed2c0463b157b20ab078c980e51e05b0839314e9441c2f743123a4e7eda1a22da3b6f8d46c6491580fdef5df0ea753740b9c646038be6b73d90a5d01a\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-11-30&amp;default_time=5:00PM&amp;client_id=660c831ed2c0463b157b20ab078c980e51e05b0839314e9441c2f743123a4e7eda1a22da3b6f8d46c6491580fdef5df0ea753740b9c646038be6b73d90a5d01a\">CHARLOTTE STREET HOTEL - SUNDAY 30TH NOVEMBER, 5PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-