      </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2YL4_bEKSzc?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">The Choral</h2>\n<p>A choral society's male members enlist in World War I, leaving the demanding Dr. Guthrie to recruit teenagers. Together, they experience the joy of singing while the young boys grapple with their impending conscription into the army.</p>\n<p>Stars Taylor Uttley, Emily Fairn, Ralph Fiennes<br><em>(Certification 12A)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/brasseriemax?default_date=2025-11-29&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=10c0156fea6c6060b58f07afb9494d76274a7b7fa01c5872173c63e1b4703ae126fa4e7ac63dd52118beacaee2d84cbee37331835d53d023ba96bcbd4bbd75d2\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-11-29&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=10c0156fea6c6060b58f07afb9494d76274a7b7fa01c5872173c63e1b4703ae126fa4e7ac63dd52118beacaee2d84cbee37331835d53d023ba96bcbd4bbd75d2\">COVENT GARDEN HOTEL - SATURDAY 29TH NOVEMBER, 8PM</a> </li>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-12-27&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=57a6