>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Love Actually</h2>\n<p>This much-loved holiday classic follows the love lives of eight very different couples during a frantic month before Christmas in London.</p>\n<p>Stars Hugh Grant, Martine McCutcheon, Liam Neeson<br><em>(Certification 15)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-12-07&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=0436edcca3da9825909bdfd84e673930086485a99586cb251f0da1fde10b248a1c9f45a72bbe22c93f21e0bf2e0061da14434a7af5fcc5ef616a4becc1e77938\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-12-07&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=0436edcca3da9825909bdfd84e673930086485a99586cb251f0da1fde10b248a1c9f45a72bbe22c93f21e0bf2e0061da14434a7af5fcc5ef616a4becc1e77938\">THE SOHO HOTEL - SUNDAY 7TH DECEMBER, 3:30PM</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/brasseriemax?default_date=2025-12-20&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=84e2b37e3ef8eacc79fe29d722ccf8ce0ee5ffcf661538a022273c794c17e14edc45b726953bd7c11e39d4fd0a0e281ee7c07812fe035b4049b2eb90b216f343\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-12-20&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=84e2b37e3ef8eacc79fe29d722ccf8ce0ee5ffcf661538a022273c794c17e14edc45b726953bd7c11e39d4fd0a0e281ee7c07812fe035b4049b2eb90b216f343\">COVENT GARDEN HOTEL - SATURDAY 20TH DECEMBER, 8PM</a> </li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n      