\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/14o38xfHlXc?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Elf</h2>\n<p>Raised as an oversized elf, Buddy travels from the North Pole to New York City to meet his biological father, Walter Hobbs, who doesn't know he exists and is in desperate need of some Christmas spirit.</p>\n<p>Stars Will Ferrell, James Caan, Bob Newhart<br><em>(Certification PG)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://fp.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-12-14&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=6707dd355f03c2b3173cbfd68f0fc8192eaf67e3151cfee4a11d05a279198ab5b71ea70de651097a7e71726410eedf6bd9a476fc0e4719d958841fba6c0b8bb3\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-12-14&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=6707dd355f03c2b3173cbfd68f0fc8192eaf67e3151cfee4a11d05a279198ab5b71ea70de651097a7e71726410eedf6bd9a476fc0e4719d958841fba6c0b8bb3\">THE SOHO HOTEL - SUNDAY 14TH DECEMBER, 3:30PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-primary section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"video-block embed js-video-with-facade video-block--poster\">\n        <div class=\"video-block__content\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/leDD6Y-Nyqg?autoplay=1\" class=\"video-block__link js-video-with-facade-link\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Click to play video\">\n                    <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=720&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=980&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=425&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=375&format=webp&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=960&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=960&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=960&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=720&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=980&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=425&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=375&v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from &#x27;Miracle on 34th Street&#x27;. A little girl sits on the lap of Santa Claus, they are looking at one another\" src=\"/media/wixojn1o/miracle-on-34th-street-1-1.jpg?width=375&amp;v=1dc4283b5b59ec0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/leDD6Y-Nyqg?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Miracle on 34th Street</h2>\n<p>A cynical lawyer and a little girl must prove that a man named Kris Kringle claiming to be Santa Claus is the real thing, after he is committed to a mental institution. (1994)</p>\n<p>Stars Mara Wilson, Richard Attenborough, Elizabeth Perkins, Dylan McDermott<br><em>(Certification U)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://fp.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-12-24&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=9242f683bf10186705d5d0756cf2daf2321c26705815b0c76b6d3245f595defe6b875d179669af20d0e35990d9e84d0c4e224a6a77344646967b5dc3a058dab3\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2025-12-24&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=9242f683bf10186705d5d0756cf2daf2321c26705815b0c76b6d3245f595defe6b875d179669af20d0e35990d9e84d0c4e224a6a77344646967b5dc3a058dab3\">THE SOHO HOTEL - WEDNESDAY 24TH DECEMBER, 3:30PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default se